@OxyKit.Mail_HostAddress = http://localhost:5026

### Health
GET {{OxyKit.Mail_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Needs admin (bootstrap)
GET {{OxyKit.Mail_HostAddress}}/api/v1/setup/needs-admin
Accept: application/json

### Login (replace body)
POST {{OxyKit.Mail_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin@phaseflow.local",
  "password": "change-me",
  "deviceId": "http-file"
}
